WEBVTT

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:04.750
It's cosplay everywhere.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.860
They look just like 
Kaminaga-sempai's drawings.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.440
Can I look at this?

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.350
Yes, go ahead.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:18.460
Well?

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:20.220
Here it is. But...

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.300
That's right. Right 
now, I'm Takeya Mikako.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.250
Oh, Hato-chan!

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.730
Why are you back to dressing like that?

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.050
Huh?

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:14.440
You just said... "Hato," didn't you?

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:22.600
Don't look over here!

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.520
Hato-kun's right over here.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:32.360
Huh?

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:33.820
What?

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:39.030
Did I do something wrong?

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.520
Well?

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:45.650
Well? Well?

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:47.730
...No.

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.790
Well? Well? Well?

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:51.790
I can't tell!

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:55.760
Yes? Is something wrong?

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.640
Oh, no! That's totally a girl!

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:01.680
No way! There's no way that's Hato!

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.980
It's working! I can fool them!

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.610
Hey, Kenjiro.

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:24.930
It's my fault...

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:26.050
What?

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:28.140
I can't see anything without my glasses.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:30.510
It's not your fault!

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:32.190
What's going on?

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:37.630
Um... I'm Ogiue, and I'm in charge here...

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:41.030
Why don't we all go somewhere else?

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:43.670
Snow Man.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:55.330
<b>The Proud Pirate King</b>

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:02.860
Hey.

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:05.650
Kaminaga-sempai, it's been forever!

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:07.240
Do you have more pictures?

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:08.630
Yeah, want to see?

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:11.890
Of course! Can I copy them again?

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.470
Sure you can.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.230
Win!

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:20.510
This is so great...

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:22.220
Hato. Hato!

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:27.100
Stop it.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:32.420
You sit there drawing by yourself, 
and you're so serious.

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:34.560
Listen, this is normal.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:37.310
This is the Art Club, not the Manga Club.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.110
You're the weird ones.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:42.750
You're in your second year, and you've 
already decided to go to an art school?

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:45.370
No, that's not true.

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:48.850
I guess I'm trying to 
get better as an artist.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:53.330
Effort's not going make you any better at 
creating manga, so long as you draw like <i>that</i>.

00:04:56.710 --> 00:04:57.710
Kon?

00:04:57.710 --> 00:04:58.840
Oh, sorry!

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:07.840
Sempai's pictures... I want to see them.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:16.290
Yeah, you're right. I'll leave the bike.

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:20.920
Tomorrow, I'll walk to the 
station and take the bus.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.010
Thanks, bye.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.100
Oh, Kaminaga.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.400
Thanks.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:37.210
Kenji, do you know this girl?

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:41.540
When I was about to graduate, 
she was in her first year, I think.

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:45.010
Oh, I see. So you were in school 
together for a little bit, Brother.

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.860
Yeah. She was famous for loving gay dudes.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:50.640
Huh? That's not quite right.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:53.580
I like couplings. Couplings.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.340
Just the pairings.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:56.550
I don't get you.

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:59.220
And in that sense, as 
captain of the Judo Club,

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:03.140
you made for a great pairing 
with anybody. Thanks!

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:06.950
Huh? What the heck? I'm not gay at all.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:09.610
It's just in our little fantasies.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:13.890
Like having vice captain Kai-san and 
the team ace, Funaki-san, fight over you.

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:16.140
I don't get you at all.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:19.590
And what's this "we"? Are there more of you?

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:21.310
What are they like?

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:24.640
I haven't seen my brother talk 
this much in a long time.

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:27.660
Hey, are you doing judo this year, Kenjiro?

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:29.120
K-Kenji...?

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:32.800
Oh, your name? Well, you're both Hato.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:36.930
Kenji did it up through middle school.  
I think he's a black belt.

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:38.750
Wow.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:43.640
Well, anyone with any talent at all can get a 
first-degree belt by the end of middle school.

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:47.940
That aside, I think he had 
more talent than I did.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:51.600
He was quick and sharp on his feet.

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:54.400
But now he's just an otaku.

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:56.680
He's never said that before.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:59.080
"Softness subdues hardness." Like that?

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.440
Yeah, I guess so.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:03.380
Subduing!

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:08.320
Which means I can assume Kenjiro's 
the top and Yuuichiro's the bottom?

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:11.090
I really, really don't get you.

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:14.460
Sempai... you're amazing.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:18.750
<b>Art Club</b>

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:16.500
Hey.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.770
Kaminaga-sempai, it's been forever!

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:21.800
These are awesome too!

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:24.710
You don't know when to stop!

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:27.070
Time to copy! Time to copy.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:38.240
Everybody's gone. Day's over, I guess.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:44.400
That's sempai's...

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:04.300
Seriously?

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:07.060
Yeah! And I ate the whole thing.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.430
Wow!

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:25.300
Sempai, you're amazing!

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:34.840
Oh, you're here.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.790
Where were you?

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:41.710
Just the bathroom. What's up, Konno-san?

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:44.280
Um, well...

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:48.270
Have you seen them? I 
think I left them here...

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:52.210
...Sempai's BL pictures, I... mean.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:57.200
Oh, these? Sorry. I was looking at them.

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:05.190
No... um...

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:10.940
This is bad! She's suspicious! What do I do?

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:13.130
Do I tell her? Maybe I'll tell her!

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:17.740
Well, I guess I was kind 
of interested in them.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:19.150
I'm telling her!

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:23.060
Actually, I... really like BL.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:26.880
It's been one of my favorite 
genres since middle school.

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:29.600
And since it was a doujinshi 
that got me into it,

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:34.530
I'm a big fan of Yotsuya Komuro, 
 Kazama Takae, and Masayuki.

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:38.010
And I guess Terada Hasumiko 
and Tomonaga Tomo.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:42.240
They both write a lot of normal stuff, so 
it's easy for a guy to get into their work too.

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:47.150
You like... BL?

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.000
Seriously?

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:54.290
Yeah. So I always wanted to 
see Kaminaga-sempai's pictures.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:55.570
You saw them?

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:57.550
In the bathroom?

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:02.100
Yeah. Why?

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:05.510
I thought it would be awkward if somebody 
walked in here while I was looking at them.

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:10.130
Wait, the bathroom?

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:15.090
But I wasn't doing anything weird 
while I was in the bathroom!

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:17.280
I'm serious! Really!

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.640
Hato.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:29.770
Do you like... sempai's pictures?

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:33.550
Yeah. I really do, I think.

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:35.840
I wish I could draw like that.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.320
Just the pictures?

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:40.320
Huh?

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.140
After that, for a while,

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:50.800
the atmosphere in the 
Art Club got much uglier.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.740
I stopped attending,

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:59.010
and Kaminaga-sempai graduated.
 By the time I got to my third year...

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:02.720
Sure you don't want to take a 
magazine to the bathroom with you?

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:09.410
The rumor that I was gay
 had spread all over the school. {AA: The Japanese wording here is "otoko ga suki," but I think invoking the g-word here would help dredge up viewers' memories of every time they were accused of being gay in school, or accused somebody else, or worried about a rumor... and I think that would make Hato's situation more identifiable.}

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.110
I-I knew it was my fault!

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:44.930
I told the rest of the club that Hato was

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:47.350
looking at BL stuff in the bathroom!

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.890
It's not your fault, Kon!

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:52.040
We were the ones who forced you 
to tell us! You were acting weird!

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:54.610
And I think it was Kimura who told the guys.

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:57.440
I really didn't do anything 
weird in the bathroom.

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:00.400
I guess I can see why 
they'd get the wrong idea.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:05.400
It's my fault that Hato 
turned into the real thing!

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:09.240
No, no. I may be dressed like this, 
but who I am inside hasn't changed.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:10.660
What do you mean?

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:14.700
I started doing this because I thought it 
would let me hang out with the rotten girls.

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.030
Huh? I don't get you!

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:18.230
I'm not surprised.

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:24.160
If you really wanted to see my 
pictures, all you had to do was ask.

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.930
Really?

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:26.800
Yeah.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:31.170
Come to think of it, you had pictures 
that looked like mine hung up.

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:32.120
And, you know...

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:35.580
Why did they mistake me for you?

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:47.450
I may have made it this far, but I 
think it's too late to join them.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:51.880
They told us only one person 
can go outside in costume.

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:54.560
Sue's outside now, so we...

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:57.800
Then go out there, Rame-sempai, and tell us!

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.330
Please!

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:03.080
It's not Hato-kun who's 
got her back turned to me.

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.410
They look alike.

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:08.030
She said that's her sempai from high 
school, right? I wonder what's going on.

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:12.700
They told me to find out what's
 going on, but that's not gonna happen.

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:14.290
I guess I'll go home.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:25.010
Oh, looks like some people Hato-kun 
knew from high school are here.

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:29.680
Looks like they didn't know about the 
crossdressing, so they're fighting.

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:36.710
Hato-kun's, well, her crossdressing...

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:41.620
She only does it when she's at our 
circle, and normally keeps it a secret.

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:44.170
Normally she comes to school as a guy.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:48.250
She switches outfits so 
people won't identify her.

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:50.750
And one of them, well...

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:55.060
Oh, it looks just like me?

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:58.030
Yes. So much that, from behind, 
we couldn't tell you apart.

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:00.930
Seriously? How's a girl supposed 
to take something like that?

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:02.550
I've got to see it!

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:05.950
Would you show me, Kenjiro? Right now?

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:08.860
Um...

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:11.520
Kaminaga-sempai, you're being very rude!

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:12.990
Am I?

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:16.220
I never liked that about you!

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:19.330
W-What's this all of a sudden? 
You're making me feel bad.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:25.170
'Cause there's only one reason 
why Hato would dress like you!

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:29.490
She doesn't realize at all!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.550
I'm right, aren't I Hato?

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.110
A-About what?

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:35.120
You don't need to play dumb too!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:44.340
It looks like Hato always... 
always liked you!

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:48.450
<b></b>

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:50.480
Well, I'm sure romance is involved somehow.

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:52.200
Their hairstyle was the same.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.930
I can't wait to hear what 
Madarame-sempai has to say.

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:57.390
That's a bad idea!

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.120
Is that true, Kenjiro?

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:02.050
Um, well...

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:06.590
I don't know... that's not 
quite right, I think...

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:09.200
How can you say that when 
you stole her art style?

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.620
So that's what that was, then!

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:16.580
Um, well... it's true that
 I always looked up to you.

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:21.940
You're a great artist and I admired 
how you didn't hide your love of BL.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:26.670
I always wanted to be like you.

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:31.450
But in the end, Hato's brother got her.

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.750
Ah, so that's it.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:40.060
Konno, Kenjiro, the two of you 
together have finally caught up to me.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:45.750
Listen. A macho big brother who used 
to do judo and has a girlfriend...

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:50.030
And a quiet, delicate little brother who 
crossdresses to look like his big brother's girl.

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:55.430
Did she get it? I'm impressed.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:56.720
What?

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:00.320
In other words, Kenjiro wants to be me,

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:03.620
and be loved by Yuichiro!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.880
<b>Yu</b>

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:05.880
<b>Ken</b>

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:05.880
<b>x</b>

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:07.730
She's nuts.

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.340
She's rotten.

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:13.540
Well, I guess I can see it.

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:15.490
And they seem to be agreeing?

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:19.080
Of course, that's not true.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:23.250
But I'm really impressed 
with the idea, I guess.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:26.230
It's normal to use your boyfriend 
in your BL fantasies.

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:31.410
It works as is, but why don't you make it 
a little more complex and change genres?

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:34.190
I see. Like the only heir 
is the big brother,

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:37.560
and the little brother is raised as a woman?

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:42.660
Yup! Set it a few years back, 
in an old family with old traditions!

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:46.090
And the little brother is a slut 
with no chastity whatsoever?

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:48.650
I could see Kenjiro like that.

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:54.030
This is creepy. I mean, I get it, but 
it's creepy! But I do get it.

00:16:55.350 --> 00:16:57.390
Hato... you...

00:16:57.900 --> 00:17:00.600
You're really a rotten girl, aren't you?

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:03.250
I've always been like this.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:07.560
I wanted to be able to talk 
like this with both of you too.

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:11.320
Yeah? Sorry.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:12.530
No...

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:15.780
Well, you can start now right?

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:19.180
You can start over as fellow rotten girls.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.530
Yes. You're right.

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:24.660
In reality, unlike video games, a weight 
difference will dictate a fight's outcome.

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:28.000
Well, that's enough for today, right?

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:33.460
Just let him off the hook today... and 
you'll still have a chance later, right?

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:38.030
I know how a woman feels.

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:41.140
But Kenjiro, you...

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:42.140
Yes?

00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:48.380
Yuichiro-san and I...

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:51.320
...we're getting married next spring.

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:55.260
We've picked a date, and 
you have to be there too.

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:57.730
Really?

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:59.970
Oh, congratulations.

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.220
Oh, thank you.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:05.250
If you get married, does that mean 
you're going to live at Hato's house?

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:06.910
That's right!

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:11.500
I'll be able to observe the Hato 
brothers in their natural habitat!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:15.010
Just thinking about it almost 
gives me a heart attack.

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:17.760
She's totally serious...

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:22.870
He told me to be the one to tell 
you, and that's why I came today.

00:18:23.230 --> 00:18:28.560
But looking back, I think your brother 
might have known how you felt.

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:34.510
And if the shock of your crush 
getting married turns you gay,

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:37.030
I don't have any right to stop you at all.

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:38.150
It will not!

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.900
Okay, guess it's time to go.

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:42.610
Already?

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:45.610
I just have to get back sometime today.

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:48.100
But I want to go to Ikebukuro.

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:52.580
Is that the main reason you're 
here? I mean I understand, but...

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:52.720
What should we do?

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:54.570
Otome Road.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.860
I'll walk you to the station.

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:58.200
Okay.

